      "position": 0,
      "content": "Transfer Impaction",
      "contentHtml": null
    },
    {
      "id": "cba86f45-6887-ef11-8474-000d3a37e3b6",
      "type": "GeneralText",
      "area": "General",
      "position": 1,
      "content": "CSU Northridge is an impacted campus. Refer to impaction information at: Transfer Impaction",
      "contentHtml": "<p class=\"ql-align-center\">CSU Northridge is an impacted campus. Refer to impaction information at: <a href=\"https://www.csun.edu/admissions-financial-aid/how-to-apply/impaction\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Transfer Impaction</a></p>"
    },
    {
      "id": "bda86f45-6887-ef11-8474-000d3a37e3b6",
      "type": "GeneralTitle",
      "area": "General",
      "position": 2,
      "content": "General Information",
      "contentHtml": null
    },
    {
      "id": "c9a86f45-6887-ef11-8474-000d3a37e3b6",
      "type": "GeneralText",
      "area": "General",
      "position": 3,
      "content": "This agreement displays all lower-division courses required in the major: CSU Northridge courses on the left, approved (articulated) transfer courses to the right. General education (Cal-GETC or CSU Northridge GE) and upper-division courses are also required to complete the bachelor's degree. Completion of all coursework listed in this agreement is not mandatory prior to admission. For CSU Northridge Undergraduate Admission Requirements , refer to Upper Division Transfer . Some coursework may be satisfied by Advanced Placement exams completed in high school. Visit AP Credit for information. Additional information about the major is available in the CSUN University Catalog . Questions regarding this agreement may be directed to: articulation@csun.edu .",
      "contentHtml": "<p><strong>This agreement displays all lower-division courses required in the major:</strong> CSU Northridge courses on the left, approved (articulated) transfer courses to the right. General education (Cal-GETC or CSU Northridge GE) and upper-division courses are also required to complete the bachelor's degree.</p><p><br></p><p>Completion of all coursework listed in this agreement is not mandatory prior to admission. For CSU Northridge Undergraduate <strong>Admission Requirements</strong>, refer to <a href=\"http://www.csun.edu/admissions-records/apply-upper-division-transfer-student#eligible\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Upper Division Transfer</a>.</p><p><br></p><p>Some coursework may be satisfied by Advanced Placement exams completed in high school. Visit <a href=\"http://catalog.csun.edu/policies/advanced-placement-ap-credit/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">AP Credit</a> for information. Additional information about the major is available in the <a href=\"http://catalog.csun.edu/programs/major/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">CSUN University Catalog</a>.</p><p><br></p><p>Questions regarding this agreement may be directed to: <a href=\"mailto:articulation@csun.edu\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">articulation@csun.edu</a>.</p>"
    },
    {
      "id": "c2a86f45-6887-ef11-8474-000d3a37e3b6",
      "type": "GeneralTitle",
      "area": "General",
      "position": 4,
      "content": "MINIMUM \"C\" GRADE REQUIREMENT",
      "contentHtml": null
    },
    {
      "id": "c1a86f45-6887-ef11-8474-000d3a37e3b6",
      "type": "GeneralText",
      "area": "General",
      "position": 5,
      "content": "All lower and upper division courses taken toward completion of the CTVA major must be completed with a grade of “ C ” or better.",
      "contentHtml": "<p class=\"highlight\">All lower and upper division courses taken toward completion of the CTVA major must be completed with a grade of “<strong>C</strong>” or better.</p>"
    },
    {
      "id": "c4a86f45-6887-ef11-8474-000d3a37e3b6",
      "type": "GeneralTitle",
      "area": "General",
      "position": 6,
      "content": "Television production - provisional",
      "contentHtml": null
    },
    {
      "id": "bea86f45-6887-ef11-8474-000d3a37e3b6",
      "type": "GeneralText",
      "area": "General",
      "position": 7,
      "content": "Students must submit a TV Production Portfolio. Upon approval of the portfolio by the CTVA faculty and the successful completion of all lower division requirements, a student may continue with upper division TV Production courses as a CTVA TV Production option major in either the Scripted Narrative Pathway or the Documentary Pathway. Students intending to continue in the TV Production Scripted Narrative Pathwy must successfully complete Fundamentals of Video Production .",
      "contentHtml": "<p>Students must submit a TV Production Portfolio. Upon approval of the portfolio by the CTVA faculty and the successful completion of all lower division requirements, a student may continue with upper division TV Production courses as a CTVA TV Production option major in either the Scripted Narrative Pathway or the Documentary Pathway. </p><p><br></p><p class=\"highlight\">Students intending to continue in the TV Production Scripted Narrative Pathwy must successfully complete <em><u>Fundamentals of Video Production</u></em>.</p>"
    }
  ],
